
  ┌─ Delete a branch ──────────┐
  │ fix/border is deleted      │
  │ here; a branch of the same │
  │ name on a remote is left   │
  │ alone. Its commits are in  │
  │ the branch it was merged   │
  │ into.                      │
  │                            │
  │ runs                       │
  │ git branch --delete --     │
  │ fix/border                 │
  │                            │
  │  y run it  n cancel        │
  └────────────────────────────┘

